It's somewhat random.  For spellbooks, it's between 5*level and 10*level
(where level is the power it takes to cast the spell).  For scrolls it
varies:

Scrolls Name               Charges
------------               -------
light                 4-8
gold detection        4-8
food detection        4-8
magic mapping         4-8
fire                  4-8

destroy armor         5-10
create monster        5-10
punishment            5-10
confuse monster       5-10

identify              5-10

enchant armor         8-16
remove curse          8-16
enchant weapon        8-16
charging              8-16

scare monster         10-20
taming                10-20
teleportation         10-20 (costly!)

genocide              15-30
